Workflow:
Order/Contract
→ Shipment
→ ETD/ETA
→ Container
→ Document Checklist
→ Transport
→ Customs
→ Arrival
→ Goods Receipt from Shipment Lines
→ Warehouse POST
→ Reconciliation
→ Close.

Bắt buộc tính:
- one order → many shipments;
- one shipment → many containers;
- partial receipt;
- shortage/excess/damage;
- ETA history;
- document version;
- cancellation/close with variance.

Không nhập lại shipment line khi sang warehouse.

## Liên kết XNK → Kho → Dự án
Shipment → Receipt → Warehouse Stock → Issue → Project.
